  "display_help": "You deliver a pair of lightning fast blows to your opponent in an effort to throw them off balance. Initial Strike deals Light Smashing damage and has a small chance to disorient your target.  This power can bruise an enemy, making them more vulnerable to damage.  Initial Strike is a Combo Builder and adds 1 Combo Level. Damage: Light, Recharge: Very Fast",
